#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/security.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trust Model (Required Reading for Open-Source Deployment)"
msgstr "信任模型（开源部署必读）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/security.md:13
msgid "FreeAnima is designed for **single-user local / intranet** deployment:"
msgstr "逸灵风设计为**单人本地 / 内网**部署："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/security.md:17
msgid ""
"Habitat RPC REST (`/rpc/v1/*` except health probe/CORS/echo) requires a "
"**Service API Token** (`Authorization: Bearer fa_at_…`); create with `anima "
"token create`. Binding `127.0.0.1` limits network exposure but does not "
"replace token auth — any local process that can reach the port still needs a "
"valid token for business routes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/security.md:17
msgid ""
"Default bind is `127.0.0.1`; for LAN access, assess CORS and network "
"isolation yourself."
msgstr "默认 bind 为 `127.0.0.1`；若需局域网访问，请自行评估 CORS 与网络隔离。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ops/security.md:17
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "**Do not** expose the service to the public internet without TLS and "
#| "token-protected clients (see [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md))."
msgid ""
"**Do not** expose the service to the public internet without TLS and token-"
"protected clients (see [`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md)）。可选 "
"`http.tls.mode: acme`（Let's Encrypt HTTP-01，公网 `:80` challenge + `:2659` "
"HTTPS）仍须 Token；不替代防火墙 / 反向代理 harden。"
msgstr ""
"**不要**在未启用 TLS 且客户端未受 token 保护的情况下将服务暴露到公网（见 "
"[`remote-access.md`](remote-access.md)）。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/security.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credential Responsibilities"
msgstr "凭证职责"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/security.md:29
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Rule                     | Description                                                                                                                                                      |\n"
#| "| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Sole authoritative store | **Vault** (ECS `vault_item` in User + Agent libraries); legacy pass (`~/.password-store`) is read-only on disk after migration — runtime no longer uses pass CLI |\n"
#| "| Never commit secrets     | Do not write API keys, tokens, DB passwords into `config.yaml` and commit to git                                                                                 |\n"
#| "| Runtime directory        | `~/.anima/` (`FREEANIMA_HOME` overridable) holds config, agent machine key (`vault/agent-machine.key`), conversations, memory—recommend `chmod 700`              |\n"
#| "| CLI plaintext output     | `anima vault get` prints Agent-library field plaintext to stdout; do not redirect to shared logs                                                                 |\n"
#| "| User master password     | Set only in Shell `/vault` or bundled Chat unlock box; **never** sent as a chat message or stored in PG messages                                                 |\n"
#| "| Chat User vault unlock   | **v1 bundled Chat only** (`src/portal/app/web` / desktop / mobile); Discord / WeChat gateways cannot unlock User library                                                    |\n"
msgid ""
"| Rule                     | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |\n"
"| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Sole authoritative store | **Vault** (ECS `vault_item` in User + Agent libraries); legacy pass (`~/.password-store`) is read-only on disk after migration — runtime no longer uses pass CLI                                                                       |\n"
"| Versioned updates        | Substantive vault item updates keep up to 10 prior snapshots (`entities.revisions`); restore via Shell `/vault` history. See [`entity-revisions`](../aspects/entity-revisions.md)                                                      |\n"
"| Never commit secrets     | Do not write API keys, tokens, DB passwords into git. Bootstrap `config.yaml`: use `env()` (or keep secrets out of the file). Runtime LLM/MCP settings live in PG — use `vault()` / `env()` there                                      |\n"
"| Runtime directory        | `~/.anima/` (`FREEANIMA_HOME` overridable) holds config, agent machine key (`vault/agent-machine.key`), conversations, memory—recommend `chmod 700`                                                                                    |\n"
"| User master password     | Set only in Shell `/vault`、bundled Chat unlock，或 Vault 浏览器扩展选项解锁；**never** sent as a chat message or stored in PG messages                                                                                                |\n"
"| Chat User vault unlock   | **v1 bundled Chat only**（`src/portal/app/web` / desktop / mobile）；Discord / WeChat gateways cannot unlock User library                                                                                                              |\n"
"| Browser extension        | 浏览器形态入口（`src/portal/extension`）；Service API Token 存 `chrome.storage.local`；主密码仅扩展内存（默认 15min）；RPC 走 background `host_permissions`。见 [`portal.md`](../modules/portal.md)、[`vault.md`](../modules/vault.md) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 规则           | 说明                                                                                                                                 |\n"
"| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| 唯一权威存储   | **Vault**（User/Agent 库 `vault_item`）；遗留 pass（`~/.password-store`）仅磁盘只读备份，运行时不再调用 pass CLI |\n"
"| 禁止入库       | 勿将 API Key、Token、DB 密码写入 `config.yaml` 并提交 git                                                                            |\n"
"| 运行时目录     | `~/.anima/`（`FREEANIMA_HOME` 可改）含 config、Agent 机读密钥（`vault/agent-machine.key`）、会话、记忆——建议 `chmod 700`              |\n"
"| CLI 明文输出   | `anima vault get` 向 stdout 打印 Agent 库字段明文；勿重定向到共享日志                                                                |\n"
"| User 主密码    | 仅在 Shell `/vault` 或 bundled Chat 解锁框设置；**勿**作为聊天消息发送或写入 PG messages                                            |\n"
"| Chat User 库解锁 | **v1 仅 bundled Chat**（`src/portal/app/web` / desktop / mobile）；Discord / 微信网关无法解锁 User 库                                          |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/security.md:31
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "`config.yaml` supports `vault(\"item_id\", \"field\")` (Agent library, "
#| "Habitat headless) and `env(\"KEY\")` for secrets; values are injected at "
#| "runtime. User-library inject for tools requires an unlocked Chat session "
#| "on the client."
msgid ""
"`config.yaml` is **bootstrap only** (read before PostgreSQL is up). Secrets "
"there support plaintext or `env(\"KEY\")` — **not** `vault()` (Vault items "
"live in PG). After Habitat is connected, runtime config in PG may use "
"`vault(\"item_id\", \"field\")` and `env(\"KEY\")`. Agent tools that need "
"CLI credentials pass per-call `secrets[]` on `terminal_run` / `code_execute` "
"(child env only). Browser form fields use `browser_type` `secret` (typed "
"into the page; never echoed in tool results). User-library resolution still "
"requires an unlocked Chat session on the client."
msgstr ""
"`config.yaml` 支持 `vault(\"item_id\", \"field\")`（Agent 库、Habitat 无头）"
"与 `env(\"KEY\")` 引用密钥；运行时注入。User 库向工具注入需在客户端已解锁 "
"Chat 会话。"

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ops/security.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Vault trust boundaries"
msgstr "Vault 信任边界"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/security.md:39
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Surface | User library                | Agent library                         |\n"
#| "| ------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Habitat PG  | Ciphertext + verifier only  | Ciphertext + machine key file on disk |\n"
#| "| LLM     | Metadata / inject ack only  | Metadata / inject ack only            |\n"
#| "| Shell   | Client master key in memory | Habitat decrypt over loopback SAP         |\n"
msgid ""
"| Surface    | User library                                                    | Agent library                                                   |\n"
"| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Habitat PG | Ciphertext + verifier only                                      | Ciphertext + machine key file on disk                           |\n"
"| LLM        | Metadata only; subprocess `secrets[]` / `browser_type` `secret` | Metadata only; subprocess `secrets[]` / `browser_type` `secret` |\n"
"| Shell      | Client master key in memory                                     | Habitat decrypt over loopback SAP                               |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 面     | User 库                     | Agent 库                              |\n"
"| ------ | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Habitat PG | 仅密文 + 校验器             | 密文 + 磁盘机读密钥文件               |\n"
"| LLM    | 仅元数据 / 注入 ack         | 仅元数据 / 注入 ack                   |\n"
"| Shell  | 客户端主密码在内存          | Habitat 经 loopback SAP 解密              |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ops/security.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data Persistence"
msgstr "数据持久化"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ops/security.md:47
#, no-wrap
